        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The purpose of this package is to provide a comprehensive and easy-to-use tool for quality assessment and to identify differentially expressed genes in the Affymetrix gene expression data.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>http://bioconductor.org/packages/2.4/bioc/html/AffyExpress.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
