        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">ProteomicsTools software suite contains a bunch of tools used in proteomics research, including identification, result parsing, quantification, and modification.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:creator>Allyson Lister</terms:creator>
        <terms:creator>Mark Reuter</terms:creator>
